 <h3><u>Aao abbas</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya hussain, ya hussain..(3)<br> Ya kashif al karbe..Ya akhee abbas..(2)<br> Ya abbas, shah abbas, ya abbas<br> Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>Shimr sar kaatne wala hai..(2)<br> bachao, bachao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>1. Karb shabbir ke chehre se hatane wale<br> aye mujhe ranj o musibat se chudane wale<br> aaj phir farz wahi apna..(2)<br> nibhao, nibhao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>2. Saamne bachho ke aisa bhi kabhi hota hia<br> aisi gustakhi ye karta hai ke dil rota hai<br> shimr se aake meri zulfein..(2)<br> chhudao, chhudao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>3. Kabhi khanjar ye dikhata hai kabhi hasta hai<br> rakh ke qur'aan pe zaanu ye laee'n baitha hai<br> kaun hu mai ye ise yaad..(2)<br> dilao, dilao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>4. Usko karta hu ishare nahi jaati bachhi<br> minnatein karti hai qatil ki hamari beti<br> mere pehlu se sakina ko..(2)<br> uthao, uthao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>5. Do sadaa aaye na maqtal mein meri maa jayi<br> mujh se is pyaas mein bola nahi jaata bhai<br> meri awaaz me awaaz..(2)<br> milao, milao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>6. Jeeteji ehle harm jaa'n se guzar jayenge<br> zibha hote hue dekhenge to marr jayenge<br> uth ke parda dar e khaima ka..(2)<br> girao, girao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>7. Sar qalam ho mera mujhko hai gawara bhaiyya<br> un ko zakhm aaye ye bardasht na hoga bhaiyya<br> haath garden se meri maa ke..(2)<br> hatao, hatao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>8. Be rida dasht mein hojaye na meri hamsheer<br> aakhri baat hai phir kuch na kahega shabbir<br> le ke zainab ko madine..(2)<br> chale jao, chale jao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>9. Laasha ek neher pe uth'ta tha kabhi girta tha<br> ibn e zehra jo takallum ye sada deta hai<br> akhri waqt hai yaseen..(2)<br> sunao, sunao abbas</p> 
  <p>Zere khanjar kaha mazloom ne<br> aao, aao abbas</p> 
  <p>Ya kashif al karbe..Ya akhee abbas</p> 
